    <generalfeedback format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<h3>Worked Solution</h3>
<p>Compute the crude and standard death rates of the two populations \(A\) and \(B\) from the following data;</p>
<br>
<p>
<table border="solid">
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th rowspan="2">Age group (years)</th>
            <th colspan="3">A</th>
            <th colspan="3">B</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <th width="15%", style="text-align:center">Population</th>
            <th width="15%", style="text-align:center">Deaths</th>
            <th width="15%", style="text-align:center">Death rate per thousand</th>
            <th width="15%", style="text-align:center">Population</th>
            <th width="15%", style="text-align:center">Deaths</th>
            <th width="15%", style="text-align:center">Death rate per thousand</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td style="text-align:center">Below \(5\)</td>
            <td style="text-align:center">\({@popn1a@}\)</td>
            <td style="text-align:center">\({@death1a@}\)</td>
            <td style="text-align:center">\({@rate_1a@}\)</td>
            <td style="text-align:center">\({@popn1b@}\)</td>
            <td style="text-align:center">\({@death1b@}\)</td>
            <td style="text-align:center">\({@rate_1b@}\)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td style="text-align:center">\(5 –30\)</td>
            <td style="text-align:center">\({@popn2a@}\)</td>
            <td style="text-align:center">\({@death2a@}\)</td>
            <td style="text-align:center">\({@rate_2a@}\)</td>
            <td style="text-align:center">\({@popn2b@}\)</td>
            <td style="text-align:center">\({@death2b@}\)</td>
            <td style="text-align:center">\({@rate_2b@}\)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
         <td style="text-align:center">\(30–40\)</td>
         <td style="text-align:center">\({@popn3a@}\)</td>
         <td style="text-align:center">\({@death3a@}\)</td>
         <td style="text-align:center">\({@rate_3a@}\)</td>
         <td style="text-align:center">\({@popn3b@}\)</td>
        <td style="text-align:center">\({@death3b@}\)</td>
        <td style="text-align:center">\({@rate_3b@}\)</td>
        </tr>
 <tr>
             <td style="text-align:center">\(40 –50\)</td>
             <td style="text-align:center">\({@popn4a@}\)</td>
             <td style="text-align:center">\({@death4a@}\)</td>
             <td style="text-align:center">\({@rate_4a@}\)</td>
            <td style="text-align:center">\({@popn4b@}\)</td>
            <td style="text-align:center">\({@death4b@}\)</td>
            <td style="text-align:center">\({@rate_4b@}\)</td>
        </tr>
 <tr>
             <td style="text-align:center">\(50 –60\)</td>
             <td style="text-align:center">\({@popn5a@}\)</td>
             <td style="text-align:center">\({@death5a@}\)</td>
             <td style="text-align:center">\({@rate_5a@}\)</td>
            <td style="text-align:center">\({@popn5b@}\)</td>
            <td style="text-align:center">\({@death5b@}\)</td>
             <td style="text-align:center">\({@rate_5b@}\)</td>
        </tr>
       <tr>
  <td style="text-align:center"><strong>Total</strong></td>
  <td style="text-align:center">\(\sum={@sum_popn_a@}\)</td>
  <td style="text-align:center">\(\sum={@sum_death_a@}\)</td>
  <td style="text-align:center"></td>
  <td style="text-align:center">\(\sum={@sum_popn_b@}\)</td>
  <td style="text-align:center">\(\sum={@sum_death_b@}\)</td>
  <td style="text-align:center"></td>
</tr>

    </tbody>
